<title>JAPAN: Sega - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sega - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		174.86		vs	  156.43</p>
<p> Operating	   12.04		vs	   11.34</p>
<p> Current	     12.76		vs	   11.04</p>
<p> Net		    6.03		vs	    5.53</p>
